<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7539" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάστημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνίσταμαι</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>height,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.9.5
			</span></i>; of animals, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.17
			</span></i>(pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῆς ἡλικίας ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					2.9.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. βασιλικόν</span> royal
				<i>majesty,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				19.92
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τραγικόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.Chr.
					18.7
				</span></i>
			 (prob.l.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ψυχὴ γαῦρόν τι ἀ. λαμβάνουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					7.2
				</span></i>
			(prob.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>protuberance, prominence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Cael.</u>
				480.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>high ground,</i> in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				2.3.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				2.14
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>erection, building,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epict.
				<u>Gnom.</u>
				62
			</span></i>(pl.): metaph., <i>structure,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλοσοφίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Herc.</u>
					1457.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>eruption,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλυκταινῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyd.
					<u>Ost.</u>
					35
				</span></i>
			:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάστεμα</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ju.</u>
				9.10
			</span></i>.al.</div>
